        "## 4. Define text preprocessing\n",
        "\n",
        "The three options control lemmatization, stop-word removal, and negation handling. Punctuation is preserved. The negation rule marks words after a negation cue until the next punctuation token; it is a simple heuristic and may miss complex sentence meanings."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "66590e5f",
